    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>God Of This World</strong> took a couple of classic RPG ideas and modernized them into a 3D top-down shooter. You'll have to explore a logical world while collecting health, jewels, keys, bullets, shield bombs, unlock doors, destroy enemy portals, all while shooting down non-stop seeker robot enemies with regular and tactical guns, enemies who are all set to fire back. Make your way to the boss of each level, and find secrets, as each level gets progressively harder.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>God Of This World</strong> took a couple of classic RPG ideas and modernized them into a 3D top-down shooter. You'll have to explore a logical world while collecting health, jewels, keys, bullets, shield bombs, unlock doors, destroy enemy portals, all while shooting down non-stop seeker robot enemies with regular and tactical guns, enemies who are all set to fire back. Make your way to the boss of each level, and find secrets, as each level gets progressively harder.</p>",
    "short_description": "What if classic RPGs were modern day 3D top-down shooters? You'll collect health, jewels, keys, bullets, shield bombs, unlock doors, destroy enemy portals, all while shooting down non-stop seeker robot enemies with regular and tactical guns, enemies who are all set to fire back.",
